  "notes": "测速改为 1–10 分评分。\n\n- 线路测速改为 1–10 分评分：8–10 分好、5–7 分中、1–4 分差，测速失败显示“不可用”，未测速显示“—”；节点列表、连接测试、连接诊断与智能客服诊断卡不再显示毫秒。\n- “按评分”排序：高分在前、同分按实测快慢；成对线路保持 A 前 B 后；不可用与未测速排在最后。自动选择与故障切换仍按原始延迟工作。\n- 测速同时进行的请求上限为 32 个（原为整组同时发出），结果边测边显示；测速失败的线路不再保留上一次的好成绩；一次“全部测速”中每条线路只测一次。\n- 节点列表在测速和排序变化时只刷新受影响的卡片。\n",
  "notesEn": "Line tests now show a 1–10 score.\n\n- Line tests now show a score from 1 to 10: 8–10 is good, 5–7 is fair and 1–4 is poor. A failed test shows \"Unavailable\" and an untested line shows \"—\". The node list, connection test, connection diagnostics and the support diagnosis card no longer show milliseconds.\n- \"By score\" sorting puts higher scores first and breaks ties by measured speed. Paired entries stay together with A before B. Unavailable and untested lines come last. Automatic selection and failover still use the raw latency.\n- At most 32 test requests run at once instead of a whole group at the same time, and results appear as they arrive. A line that fails a test no longer keeps its previous good result, and \"Test all groups\" tests each line only once.\n- The node list now refreshes only the affected cards while testing or re-sorting.\n",
